Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_apache
Fix: Keep Dav On only where WebDAV is needed, behind authentication.
References: Apache Module mod_dav
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST CM-6, CM-7; ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

WebDAV writes are on for the scope named: PUT, DELETE and the
other authoring methods reach the filesystem wherever the scope's
authentication allows. Keep Dav On only on the collections that
need it, behind authentication only the writers have.
